- Hey, Lily!
<i>- Yes?</i>

1145
00:57:49,021 --> 00:57:50,896
- Open that post!
<i>- Okay!</i>

1146
00:57:50,979 --> 00:57:52,979
- Jessie.
- Bonnie's gotta see this.

1147
00:57:53,062 --> 00:57:55,021
Show her again.
Where is she? Hey, Lily.

1148
00:57:55,104 --> 00:57:55,937
- Hey, Lily!
<i>- Yes?</i>

1149
00:57:56,021 --> 00:57:57,062
- Show the post.
<i>- Can I help you?</i>

1150
00:57:57,146 --> 00:57:58,021
- Share it everywhere!
- Share!

1151
00:57:58,104 --> 00:57:58,937
<i>- Yes!</i>
- Share!

1152
