She ditched you, Jessie.

1295
01:05:40,396 --> 01:05:41,979
Because of you!

1296
01:05:42,062 --> 01:05:44,312
Because of all you darn devices

1297
01:05:44,396 --> 01:05:46,187
making kids act older.

1298
01:05:46,271 --> 01:05:48,229
You stole all our time.

1299
01:05:48,312 --> 01:05:51,104
I wanted to make a difference.
I needed to make a difference.

1300
01:05:51,187 --> 01:05:52,521
And you ruined it.

1301
01:05:52,604 --> 01:05:53,604
Ow.

1302
01:05:53,687 --> 01:05:55,729
- Smarty, you okay?
- I'm-I'm sorry.

1303
01:05:55,812 --> 01:05:59,062
- Are you hurt? Did you crack?
- I'm fine. I'm fine.

1304
01:05:59,146 --> 01:06:01,229
For a rag doll, you throw
quite a punch, cowgir…

1305
01:06:02,104 --> 01:06:03,479
Cowgirl?

1306
01:06:04,854 --> 01:06:06,479
-

1307
01:06:06,562 --> 01:06:07,604
Jessie?

1308
01:06:17,437 --> 01:06:19,104
Uh, Sheriff?

1309
01:06:19,187 --> 01:06:20,854
I'm sorry, Smarty.

1310
01:06:20,937 --> 01:06:22,146
It's not you.

1311
01:06:23,062 --> 01:06:25,229
I'm the one that's useless.

1312
01:06:25,312 --> 01:06:26,646
-

1313
01:06:37,687 --> 01:06:38,979
Bullseye!

1314
01:06:41,521 --> 01:06:44,104
Poor Jessie. Gotta find a way in.

1315
01:06:45,479 --> 01:06:48,104
Buzz. Buzz, where are you going?

1316
01:06:48,187 --> 01:06:50,187
Let's talk about this.

1317
01:06:50,271 --> 01:06:51,979
- Huh?

1318
01:06:53,812 --> 01:06:56,354
Uh, what… what is going on?

1319
01:06:56,437 --> 01:06:57,646
- State your name.
- Whoa, whoa.

1320
01:06:57,729 --> 01:06:59,729
- And your purpose.
- Hey, guys.

1321
01:06:59,812 --> 01:07:01,562
- Take him in.
- Guys! Whoa!

1322
01:07:03,271 --> 01:07:05,021
Wait, wait. What's going on?

1323
01:07:05,104 --> 01:07:06,771
My poncho!

1324
01:07:07,271 --> 01:07:08,271
Quiet, assassin!

1325
01:07:08,354 --> 01:07:11,021
Assassin? No, I can't…

1326
01:07:12,271 --> 01:07:13,771
Buzz?

1327
01:07:13,854 --> 01:07:15,896
How do you know who we are? Who sent you?

1328
01:07:15,979 --> 01:07:18,146
Oh, geez! What… I…

1329
01:07:18,229 --> 01:07:20,271
Talk!

1330
01:07:20,354 --> 01:07:22,104
- Talk about what?

1331
01:07:22,187 --> 01:07:24,187
- What am I supposed to know?
- You bear a holster.

1332
01:07:24,271 --> 01:07:27,187
You were positioned outside
our leader's stronghold.

1333
01:07:27,271 --> 01:07:29,021
You are an agent of Zurg!

1334
01:07:29,104 --> 01:07:30,604
Zurg? No! Hey!

1335
01:07:30,687 --> 01:07:32,187
I don't even know who your leader is!

1336
01:07:32,271 --> 01:07:34,729
Liar! You wish to harm
the red-haired maiden

1337
01:07:34,812 --> 01:07:36,229
who bears the mark of Star Command.

1338
01:07:36,312 --> 01:07:37,521
- Jessie.
- No.

1339
01:07:37,604 --> 01:07:39,271
Wait!

1340
01:07:39,354 --> 01:07:41,396
He is not an agent of Zurg.

1341
01:07:42,562 --> 01:07:43,771
Well, then, who's this old man?

1342
01:07:43,854 --> 01:07:45,854
Why do people keep saying that?

1343
01:07:45,937 --> 01:07:46,937
I'm not that old!

1344
01:07:47,021 --> 01:07:49,854
This old man is a toy.

1345
01:07:49,937 --> 01:07:51,896
Hmm. A toy?

1346
01:07:52,396 --> 01:07:54,729
Yes. We are all toys!

1347
01:07:54,812 --> 01:07:56,354
Toy…

1348
01:07:56,437 --> 01:07:58,896
Our mission on this planet is
to make a child happy.

1349
01:07:58,979 --> 01:07:59,979
I've been dreaming about that.

1350
01:08:00,062 --> 01:08:01,062
You know what I mean?

1351
01:08:01,146 --> 01:08:03,229
- To play!
- To play. Play.

1352
01:08:03,312 --> 01:08:04,396
Hey! Buzz, can you help me…

1353
01:08:04,479 --> 01:08:06,354
…get out
of the mouth of this pig?

1354
01:08:06,437 --> 01:08:09,979
Search your feelings, Buzz.
You know it to be true!

1355
01:08:10,062 --> 01:08:12,604
-

1356
01:08:12,687 --> 01:08:15,896
And the red-haired maiden
you seek is our toy leader.

1357
01:08:15,979 --> 01:08:17,896
Her name is Sheriff Jessie.

1358
01:08:17,979 --> 01:08:18,979
Sheriff Jessie.

1359
01:08:19,062 --> 01:08:22,229
Sheriff Jessie is trapped
inside that stronghold.

1360
01:08:22,312 --> 01:08:24,437
We must infiltrate it and rescue her

1361
01:08:24,521 --> 01:08:25,687
and her trusty steed.

1362
01:08:25,771 --> 01:08:27,104
How do you know all this?

1363
01:08:27,729 --> 01:08:30,104
Because I am her deputy.

1364
01:08:31,687 --> 01:08:33,062
Star Command.

1365
01:08:33,146 --> 01:08:36,271
Then this old man is a toy?

1366
01:08:36,354 --> 01:08:38,146
This pig has bad breath!

1367
01:08:38,229 --> 01:08:39,312
Oh, yeah, him.

1368
01:08:39,396 --> 01:08:41,437
He's my sidekick. You can untie him.

1369
01:08:41,521 --> 01:08:45,354
And by the way, everybody,
Zurg is our dad.

1370
01:08:45,437 --> 01:08:48,521
No! No! - Yeah.

1371
01:08:55,687 --> 01:08:57,479
Hey. What's on your mind?

1372
01:08:57,979 --> 01:08:58,979
I don't know.

1373
01:08:59,062 --> 01:09:00,687
I just hope that girl's okay.

1374
01:09:00,771 --> 01:09:03,312
Aw. She'll be fine, sweetie.

1375
01:09:03,396 --> 01:09:04,521
Don't you worry.

1376
01:09:04,604 --> 01:09:06,771
Hey, guys! Is anyone hungry?

1377
01:09:06,854 --> 01:09:08,187
- Me, me!
- Starving!

1378
01:09:08,271 --> 01:09:09,854
Can we get Pasta Prairie, Baba?

1379
01:09:09,937 --> 01:09:12,396
Ooh, I like
the way you think, <i>anushikes</i>.

1380
01:09:14,604 --> 01:09:16,812
- Spread out.

1381
01:09:17,521 --> 01:09:18,646
Not here.

1382
01:09:19,187 --> 01:09:20,437
Not here.

1383
01:09:20,521 --> 01:09:21,562
Definitely not here.

1384
01:09:22,354 --> 01:09:23,937
Blast! Where could she be?

1385
01:09:24,021 --> 01:09:26,437
Commander! We found
these electronic devices.

1386
01:09:26,521 --> 01:09:29,562
Hey, Micro-Chippendales!
Hands off.

1387
01:09:29,646 --> 01:09:31,354
- Whoa!

1388
01:09:31,437 --> 01:09:33,396
I'm getting a major signal
from all you dudes.

1389
01:09:33,479 --> 01:09:36,271
- I've got full bars.
- Me too. I can map for miles!

1390
01:09:36,354 --> 01:09:38,187
These guys are their own hot spot.

1391
01:09:39,729 --> 01:09:40,979
Oh, no. They're one of them.

1392
01:09:41,062 --> 01:09:43,771
They're one of us! Nice.

1393
01:09:43,854 --> 01:09:45,271
Hey, uh, this one's broken, by the way.

1394
01:09:45,354 --> 01:09:47,062
Where are you hiding Jessie, you machine?

1395
01:09:47,146 --> 01:09:48,646
Hey, hey. Easy there.

1396
01:09:48,729 --> 01:09:50,271
- Yeah!
- We're Jessie's friends!

1397
01:09:50,354 --> 01:09:52,812
And I have a name. It's Smarty Pants.

1398
01:09:52,896 --> 01:09:54,062
Hygiene instructor.

1399
01:09:54,146 --> 01:09:55,271
He'll wipe your--

1400
01:09:55,354 --> 01:09:57,354
This is serious, Mr. Pants.

1401
01:09:57,437 --> 01:09:59,312
It is my sworn duty as a Space Ranger--

1402
01:09:59,396 --> 01:10:01,437
- Ha, ha, you said "doody."
- Why, you!

1403
01:10:01,521 --> 01:10:03,146
Clearly, we're all friends with Jessie,

1404
01:10:03,229 --> 01:10:05,021
so can you just tell us where she is?

1405
01:10:05,104 --> 01:10:06,521
She went to the tire-swing hill!

1406
01:10:06,604 --> 01:10:07,937
It's at the far end of the ranch.

1407
01:10:08,021 --> 01:10:09,479
Gonna take me forever to waddle there.

1408
01:10:09,562 --> 01:10:11,437
Well, we'll need a way to get there.

1409
01:10:12,146 --> 01:10:13,354
Commander Lightyear.

1410
01:10:15,521 --> 01:10:16,812
- Oh, my.

1411
01:10:19,604 --> 01:10:20,854
Whoa.

1412
01:10:30,396 --> 01:10:33,021
Bonnie? Did something happen
with your friends?

1413
01:10:38,479 --> 01:10:39,479
Can you show me?

1414
01:10:41,146 --> 01:10:44,021
You're not in trouble, Bonnie. I promise.

1415
01:10:52,896 --> 01:10:54,104
Oh, sweetie.

1416
01:10:54,687 --> 01:10:58,104
You know that you can always
talk with me and Dad, right?

1417
01:10:58,646 --> 01:11:00,437
About anything.

1418
01:11:00,521 --> 01:11:03,729
Because we love you, Bonnie, so much.

1419
01:11:04,646 --> 01:11:07,437
I wouldn't change
a single thing about you.

1420
01:11:08,104 --> 01:11:10,937
And I think a real friend
would feel the same.

1421
01:11:11,021 --> 01:11:12,021
Don't you?

1422
01:11:13,354 --> 01:11:14,437
But how about we take a break

1423
01:11:14,521 --> 01:11:16,562
from the group chat for now. Okay?

1424
01:11:17,229 --> 01:11:18,437
Let's get some ice cream.

1425
01:11:27,646 --> 01:11:29,312
Trust me, you're gonna love it.

1426
01:11:30,562 --> 01:11:31,771
Cool! - Sure.

1427
01:11:43,437 --> 01:11:46,104
Bonnie, they don't have chocolate chip.

1428
01:11:46,187 --> 01:11:47,771
Come pick another flavor.

1429
01:12:07,104 --> 01:12:09,354
-

1430
01:12:09,437 --> 01:12:12,187
Mom, where's Lilypad?

1431
01:12:12,271 --> 01:12:13,979
I'm sorry, Bonnie.

1432
01:12:32,854 --> 01:12:34,604
-

1433
01:12:34,687 --> 01:12:36,062
- What is it?

1434
01:12:36,146 --> 01:12:37,812
-

1435
01:12:38,646 --> 01:12:39,646
-

1436
01:12:39,729 --> 01:12:40,979
Bullseye.

1437
01:12:41,062 --> 01:12:42,646
You shouldn't have followed me.

1438
01:12:42,729 --> 01:12:45,312
- Oh, bad horse.

1439
01:12:48,979 --> 01:12:52,354
You go back to Blaze's,
Bullseye. You're better off.

1440
01:12:52,437 --> 01:12:54,562
-

1441
01:12:54,646 --> 01:12:58,062
I'm serious. She'll take good care of you.

1442
01:12:58,146 --> 01:12:59,604
And all those horses…

1443
01:13:03,354 --> 01:13:05,354
Bullseye, no.

1444
01:13:05,437 --> 01:13:07,104
I'm not going with you.

1445
01:13:07,604 --> 01:13:09,229
I…

1446
01:13:09,312 --> 01:13:11,396
can't do this again.

1447
01:13:11,479 --> 01:13:12,479
I can't…

1448
01:13:13,646 --> 01:13:15,229
love another kid

1449
01:13:15,312 --> 01:13:17,979
just to find out I never mattered.

1450
01:13:19,687 --> 01:13:20,562
I…

1451
01:13:21,354 --> 01:13:22,979
I can't.

1452
01:13:40,896 --> 01:13:43,604
- I didn't write that.

1453
01:13:44,437 --> 01:13:45,937
It must have been…

1454
01:14:02,521 --> 01:14:03,687
Emily?

1455
01:14:06,604 --> 01:14:09,104
Daffodil, dig.

1456
01:14:26,104 --> 01:14:27,146
Wait.

1457
01:14:28,396 --> 01:14:30,479
This ain't stuff from Emily.

1458
01:14:30,562 --> 01:14:31,562
It…

1459
01:14:32,187 --> 01:14:33,312
It's newer.

1460
01:14:36,021 --> 01:14:37,187
It doesn't make any sense.

1461
01:14:37,271 --> 01:14:39,396
She wouldn't have any of this stuff.

1462
01:14:39,479 --> 01:14:40,979
She'd be…

1463
01:14:44,354 --> 01:14:46,104
all grown-up.

1464
01:14:49,562 --> 01:14:50,562
Wait.

1465
01:14:57,396 --> 01:15:00,187
Emily named her daughter…

1466
01:15:04,104 --> 01:15:05,521
after me.

1467
01:15:15,354 --> 01:15:16,687
Really?

1468
01:15:29,187 --> 01:15:30,937
-

1469
01:15:31,021 --> 01:15:32,312
-

1470
01:15:32,396 --> 01:15:33,729
Uh…

1471
01:15:33,812 --> 01:15:35,687
Whoa!

1472
01:15:40,354 --> 01:15:41,687
Jessie? Bullseye!

1473
01:15:41,771 --> 01:15:42,979
Hey, I found 'em!

1474
01:15:43,062 --> 01:15:44,104
Woody?

1475
01:15:45,062 --> 01:15:46,771
- Buzz!
- Jessie!

1476
01:15:47,812 --> 01:15:48,896
You're okay.

1477
01:15:48,979 --> 01:15:50,979
What… What are you doing here?

1478
01:15:51,062 --> 01:15:52,604
We came for you, Jessie.

1479
01:15:52,687 --> 01:15:53,729
For me?

1480
01:15:53,812 --> 01:15:55,271
We all did.

1481
01:16:03,979 --> 01:16:06,854
Well, howdy-do, Sheriff?

1482
01:16:06,937 --> 01:16:08,229
We come bearing Buzzes.

1483
01:16:08,312 --> 01:16:10,729
Looks like 50 to me,
but I can only count to two.

1484
01:16:13,104 --> 01:16:15,437
Star Command. Star Command.
Star Command. Star Command.

1485
01:16:15,521 --> 01:16:17,562
Star Command. Star Command. Star Command.

1486
01:16:18,104 --> 01:16:19,437
Star Command.

1487
01:16:19,521 --> 01:16:21,562
All right, all right, calm down.

1488
01:16:21,646 --> 01:16:22,771
Give her some room, fellas.

1489
01:16:22,854 --> 01:16:24,812
- Uh, Buzz.
- Yes?

1490
01:16:24,896 --> 01:16:27,521
Hey, hey, she meant that for me. Just me.

1491
01:16:28,146 --> 01:16:30,396
- We saw Bonnie give you away.
- You did?

1492
01:16:30,479 --> 01:16:31,896
It doesn't make any sense.

1493
01:16:31,979 --> 01:16:33,229
You're not useless, Sheriff!

1494
01:16:33,312 --> 01:16:35,312
- We love you!
- So much!

1495
01:16:43,229 --> 01:16:44,604
Look, I'm okay.

1496
01:16:45,271 --> 01:16:48,021
Bonnie's growing up.

1497
01:16:49,229 --> 01:16:54,312
And we don't get to decide
when and how that happens.

1498
01:16:55,562 --> 01:16:56,979
All that matters is

1499
01:16:57,062 --> 01:16:59,021
we were there at the right time

1500
01:16:59,104 --> 01:17:00,771
to help her along.

1501
01:17:07,646 --> 01:17:09,729
And I gotta believe we were.

1502
01:17:10,896 --> 01:17:12,937
You make us proud to be toys, Jessie.

1503
01:17:13,021 --> 01:17:14,562
What are you doing? Stop!

1504
01:17:14,646 --> 01:17:16,646
Sorry, guys. Sorry.

1505
01:17:17,812 --> 01:17:20,729
Just wish she had at least
connected with Blaze.

1506
01:17:21,687 --> 01:17:22,937
Wait.

1507
01:17:23,021 --> 01:17:25,187
Connect! They still can!

1508
01:17:25,271 --> 01:17:26,771
Lilypad can do that!

1509
01:17:26,854 --> 01:17:28,104
- Lilypad?
- Lilypad?

1510
01:17:29,896 --> 01:17:31,687
-

1511
01:17:36,604 --> 01:17:38,271
Okay, okay. Guys, message coming through.

1512
01:17:38,354 --> 01:17:40,271
"Jessie, I'm so sorry.

1513
01:17:40,354 --> 01:17:42,354
Chose wrong friends. Hurt Bonnie."

1514
01:17:42,437 --> 01:17:43,562
- Oh, no.
- Bonnie.

1515
01:17:43,646 --> 01:17:46,187
Smarty, send a reply. "You can fix it."

1516
01:17:49,771 --> 01:17:51,104
-

1517
01:17:51,604 --> 01:17:54,229
"No, I can't. Threw myself away."

1518
01:17:54,312 --> 01:17:55,937
- What?
- "On donation truck."

1519
01:17:56,021 --> 01:17:59,354
Jumpin' Jehoshaphat!
Now she throws herself away?

1520
01:17:59,437 --> 01:18:01,229
We're goin' after her.

1521
01:18:01,312 --> 01:18:02,521
- What?
- But how?

1522
01:18:02,604 --> 01:18:05,937
Smarty, tell Lily to send
a photo of where she is.

1523
01:18:06,687 --> 01:18:07,687
Got it.

1524
01:18:07,771 --> 01:18:09,646
Snappy, zoom in on that blurry road sign.

1525
01:18:09,729 --> 01:18:11,521
Look at you with that tech talk, cowgirl.

1526
01:18:11,604 --> 01:18:12,812
Martin Avenue.

1527
01:18:12,896 --> 01:18:14,396
Atlas, can you get us to that truck?

1528
01:18:14,479 --> 01:18:16,312
Already mapped it, cowboy lady.

1529
01:18:16,396 --> 01:18:18,687
Tell Lily to keep sending
photos of where she is.

1530
01:18:18,771 --> 01:18:20,104
We're getting her back.

1531
01:18:20,187 --> 01:18:21,521
Yes, Sheriff.

1532
01:18:21,604 --> 01:18:23,104
Jessie, when you have a moment,

1533
01:18:23,187 --> 01:18:24,479
there's something you'd like to ask me…

1534
01:18:24,562 --> 01:18:26,562
- I'd like to ask you.
- Sure thing, Deputy.

1535
01:18:26,646 --> 01:18:28,604
- Now, a little help?
- Yes, Sheriff.

1536
01:18:29,812 --> 01:18:31,562
<i>Yeehaw!</i>

1537
01:18:31,646 --> 01:18:33,104
Let's ride.

1538
01:18:34,521 --> 01:18:36,271
Whoa! Hey!

1539
01:18:38,854 --> 01:18:40,562
- Hey! Hey, wait for us!
- Hey! Wait for us!

1540
01:18:41,729 --> 01:18:42,896
-

1541
01:18:54,437 --> 01:18:56,229
- She's not far.

1542
01:18:56,312 --> 01:18:59,187
If we go south five blocks,
then east for two,

1543
01:18:59,271 --> 01:19:00,187
we might be able to head 'em off

1544
01:19:00,271 --> 01:19:01,104
before they reach the highway.

1545
01:19:01,187 --> 01:19:02,187
Car!

1546
01:19:05,562 --> 01:19:07,229
Clear!

1547
01:19:07,729 --> 01:19:08,854
She just passed a gas station.

1548
01:19:08,937 --> 01:19:11,187
Passed gas. Sorry, had to.

1549
01:19:11,271 --> 01:19:12,812
We're close. Take a shortcut.

1550
01:19:12,896 --> 01:19:14,229
Down this next road to the right.

1551
01:19:17,271 --> 01:19:18,396
-

1552
01:19:19,437 --> 01:19:20,271
It's a house!

1553
01:19:20,354 --> 01:19:21,687
I don't get it. There should be a road.

1554
01:19:21,771 --> 01:19:24,021
Probably was a road
five years ago. Old map.

1555
01:19:24,104 --> 01:19:26,354
- Recalculating.
- No time. We're going through.

1556
01:19:26,437 --> 01:19:28,021
- Wait, what?
- Going through?

1557
01:19:36,812 --> 01:19:37,771
Down, boy, down!

1558
01:19:39,646 --> 01:19:41,479
- Whoa, whoa.

1559
01:19:41,562 --> 01:19:42,812
-

1560
01:19:45,187 --> 01:19:46,521
Yeehaw!

1561
01:19:46,604 --> 01:19:48,271
-

1562
01:19:57,021 --> 01:20:00,062
The truck. I see it up ahead.

1563
01:20:00,146 --> 01:20:01,562
-

1564
01:20:01,646 --> 01:20:02,896
Follow me.

1565
01:20:02,979 --> 01:20:04,062
Yes, Sheriff.

1566
01:20:10,896 --> 01:20:12,937
-

1567
01:20:13,021 --> 01:20:13,854
Whoo!

1568
01:20:13,937 --> 01:20:15,937
