- Lily!

1570
01:20:17,312 --> 01:20:19,146
- Lily, where are ya?
- Lily!

1571
01:20:19,229 --> 01:20:20,729
- Lily?
- Lilypad, where you at?

1572
01:20:20,812 --> 01:20:22,021
Hey, Lily.

1573
01:20:22,104 --> 01:20:23,354
<i>Yes, can I help you?</i>

1574
01:20:24,896 --> 01:20:27,812
Lily. It's okay. We got ya.

1575
01:20:27,896 --> 01:20:29,104
You shouldn't have come, Jessie.

1576
01:20:29,187 --> 01:20:31,187
Nuh-uh. No time for pity parties, Lily.

1577
01:20:31,271 --> 01:20:33,437
Bonnie still needs you to make a friend.

1578
01:20:33,521 --> 01:20:34,479
Me? But I…

1579
01:20:35,479 --> 01:20:38,771
I made a major miscalculation
with Kara, Chelsea and Heidi.

1580
01:20:38,854 --> 01:20:40,687
You were right. Bonnie's different.

1581
01:20:40,771 --> 01:20:41,646
She deserves better.

1582
01:20:41,729 --> 01:20:42,729
Lily.

1583
01:20:42,812 --> 01:20:45,146
You didn't know those girls
were wrong for Bonnie.

1584
01:20:45,229 --> 01:20:46,729
No, I'm wrong for Bonnie.

1585
01:20:46,812 --> 01:20:49,771
- I'm the one who caused this.
- Well, then help me fix it.

1586
01:20:49,854 --> 01:20:52,021
