1587
01:20:52,104 --> 01:20:53,229
- You did?
- Yep.

1588
01:20:53,312 --> 01:20:55,479
So, how about you and me connect them?

1589
01:20:55,562 --> 01:20:57,396
Uh… Okay.

1590
