- Snap!
- Yes, yes, yes, yes!

1600
01:21:31,562 --> 01:21:32,854
No way.

1601
01:21:32,937 --> 01:21:34,896
Oh, yeah. Way.

1602
01:21:39,646 --> 01:21:40,854
Ready, Sheriff?

1603
01:21:40,937 --> 01:21:42,146
Punch it, Lily.

1604
01:21:56,604 --> 01:21:58,437
Whoa.

1605
