Show-offs!

1607
01:22:09,396 --> 01:22:11,146
Wow.

1608
01:22:11,229 --> 01:22:12,646
Whoo-hoo!

1609
01:22:13,229 --> 01:22:14,562
- Whoo!
- Whoo!

1610
01:22:16,271 --> 01:22:18,271
Now, this is flying.

1611
01:22:18,354 --> 01:22:19,479
With style!

1612
01:22:19,562 --> 01:22:22,229
Yeehaw!

1613
01:22:27,562 --> 01:22:28,979
So, we're clear on the plan?

1614
01:22:29,062 --> 01:22:31,146
Once you're at Bonnie's,
you send the message.

1615
01:22:31,229 --> 01:22:33,146
Blaze brings me and Bullseye to the house,

1616
01:22:33,229 --> 01:22:35,521
and this time, they connect!

1617
01:22:35,604 --> 01:22:37,729
Jessie, wait.
What if Bonnie rejects you again?

1618
01:22:37,812 --> 01:22:40,437
If they become friends, it's all worth it.

1619
01:22:40,521 --> 01:22:42,021
Yes, Sheriff.

1620
01:22:43,146 --> 01:22:46,104
Huh? Wait. Jessie, wait!

1621
01:22:46,187 --> 01:22:47,271
What?

1622
01:22:48,771 --> 01:22:49,937
What is it, Buzz?

1623
01:22:50,021 --> 01:22:51,146
Just listen to me.

1624
