1630
01:23:16,062 --> 01:23:17,937
Cheer up, boys. She'll be back.

1631
01:23:18,021 --> 01:23:19,437
We have a plan!

1632
01:23:19,937 --> 01:23:22,562
At ease, Ranger. At ease.

1633
01:23:43,146 --> 01:23:44,604
Men, you know your mission.

1634
01:23:44,687 --> 01:23:45,687
Yes, Commander.

1635
01:23:50,312 --> 01:23:51,562
Woody! Buzz!

1636
01:23:51,646 --> 01:23:53,062
- What?
- Lily!

1637
01:23:53,146 --> 01:23:54,562
- Oh, no, no, no.
- Foul device.

1638
01:23:54,646 --> 01:23:55,854
What's she doing here?

1639
01:23:55,937 --> 01:23:57,437
She's one of us, guys. Deal with it.

1640
01:23:57,521 --> 01:23:58,521
Listen up, everyone.

1641
01:23:58,604 --> 01:24:00,729
Lily and Jessie
have a plan to help Bonnie.

1642
01:24:00,812 --> 01:24:02,562
Okay, what do you need us to do?

1643
