Nothing.

1644
01:24:03,604 --> 01:24:05,396
- Nothing?
- That's easy.

1645
01:24:05,479 --> 01:24:07,104
Jessie already did the hard work.

1646
01:24:07,187 --> 01:24:08,271
Classic Jessica.

1647
01:24:08,354 --> 01:24:11,396
All that's left for me
is to send a message.

1648
01:24:29,437 --> 01:24:31,187
It's up to the girls now.

1649
01:24:51,979 --> 01:24:54,479
Hey, sweetie.
Look what I found in the car.

1650
01:24:55,521 --> 01:24:57,646
It's okay. We turned off the chat.

1651
01:25:14,396 --> 01:25:16,771
Bonnie. You have a friend at the door.

1652
01:25:18,812 --> 01:25:20,187
<i>- Let's try to beat…</i>
<i>- </i>Hi, Bonnie.

1653
01:25:20,271 --> 01:25:22,271
<i>- …our high score.</i>
- I brought your dolls.

1654
01:25:24,021 --> 01:25:25,729
Bonnie, come say hi.

1655
01:25:25,812 --> 01:25:26,854
Okay.

1656
01:25:35,437 --> 01:25:36,479
Hi.

1657
01:25:37,312 --> 01:25:38,312
Hi.

1658
01:25:46,062 --> 01:25:47,937
I'm sorry. I don't play with toys--

1659
