I like your boots.

1669
01:26:37,896 --> 01:26:40,146
I… I really like your socks.

1670
01:26:42,854 --> 01:26:45,646
Do you like my beard, madame?

1671
01:26:46,354 --> 01:26:48,979
Very impressive, m'lady.

1672
01:26:49,062 --> 01:26:51,687
Yes, I'm one billion years old.

1673
01:26:51,771 --> 01:26:53,771
That's why it's so glorious.

1674
01:27:01,479 --> 01:27:02,729
Um…

1675
01:27:02,812 --> 01:27:04,396
Do you wanna play?

1676
01:27:06,812 --> 01:27:07,812
Okay.

1677
