to witness the most wonderfulest union

1687
01:27:57,229 --> 01:27:58,562
of Sheriff Jessie

1688
01:27:58,646 --> 01:28:01,312
and Buzz-tholomew MacLightyear.

1689
01:28:01,396 --> 01:28:03,062
-

1690
