please put this ring
onto Buzz's itty-bitty finger

1692
01:28:14,604 --> 01:28:16,396
and make your vows.

1693
01:28:17,896 --> 01:28:20,396
Buzz, will you take this ring

1694
01:28:20,479 --> 01:28:22,104
