And there's confetti in the craft drawer.

1707
01:28:45,646 --> 01:28:46,979
Oh, congrats, you two.

1708
01:28:47,062 --> 01:28:48,479
Don't worry. I took plenty of photos

1709
01:28:48,562 --> 01:28:49,646
