1710
01:28:49,729 --> 01:28:52,437
That's really sweet of you, Lily.

1711
01:28:54,062 --> 01:28:55,062
Mmm.

1712
01:28:55,646 --> 01:28:57,062
You done good, Sheriff.

1713
01:28:57,854 --> 01:28:59,771
You can call me Jessica.

1714
01:29:00,312 --> 01:29:01,937
Okay, I will. Jessica.

1715
01:29:02,646 --> 01:29:04,104
Actually, no. No.

1716
01:29:04,187 --> 01:29:05,187
Okay.

1717
