Hey, when you get a chance,

1718
01:29:07,771 --> 01:29:10,146
can you introduce me to the ring bearer?

1719
01:29:10,229 --> 01:29:11,812
- Oh.
- Awooga.

1720
01:29:11,896 --> 01:29:12,937
Okay.

1721
01:29:13,021 --> 01:29:14,104
They're coming.

1722
01:29:15,021 --> 01:29:16,396
I got it. That's awesome.

1723
