- Woody, will you…
- Um…

1752
01:30:18,437 --> 01:30:20,854
- …hold these? I'll drive.
- Well…

1753
01:30:21,896 --> 01:30:23,021
Ooh, la la.

1754
01:30:27,021 --> 01:30:29,104
- Yes! Oh, look at them.
- They're glowing.

1755
01:30:29,187 --> 01:30:30,562
They're such good friends.

1756
01:30:30,646 --> 01:30:31,896
Okay, save that one.

1757
01:30:31,979 --> 01:30:33,312
- Fierce.
- Oh, my gosh. Yes!

1758
01:30:33,396 --> 01:30:34,354
Okay, Buzz with the kilt.

1759
01:30:34,437 --> 01:30:36,312
I'm moving to Palm Springs.

1760
