But, Trixie, why?

1762
01:30:42,271 --> 01:30:44,562
Hey, would you ever wanna sleep over?

1763
01:30:44,646 --> 01:30:47,479
Yes! That'd be so fun.

1764
01:30:47,979 --> 01:30:49,104
Look. Look, look.

1765
01:30:51,312 --> 01:30:53,437
<i>Friends forever, partner.</i>

1766
01:30:53,521 --> 01:30:56,604
Come on, Jessie.
We'll take my spaceship.

1767
01:30:56,687 --> 01:30:58,646
- Where to first?
- Neptune!

1768
