What are you guys doing?

1769
01:30:59,937 --> 01:31:01,354
Honeymooning!

1770
01:31:01,437 --> 01:31:02,437
Wanna come?

1771
01:31:02,521 --> 01:31:05,021
- Sure!
- Wait, wait.

1772
01:31:05,104 --> 01:31:06,521
Look, Jessie, space dolphins!

1773
01:31:06,604 --> 01:31:07,604
Hi, dolphin.

1774
