♪ <i>Man, it's been a while</i> ♪

1789
01:32:09,229 --> 01:32:10,896
♪ <i>But I knew it, I knew you </i>♪

1790
01:32:13,229 --> 01:32:15,229
♪ <i>I knew it, I knew you</i> ♪

1791
01:32:16,104 --> 01:32:18,312
♪ <i>I knew you</i> ♪

1792
01:32:18,396 --> 01:32:19,396
♪ <i>All your blues</i> ♪

1793
