♪ <i>And I remembered</i>
<i>I loved you </i>♪

1803
01:32:47,396 --> 01:32:49,771
♪ <i>Came back when it mattered</i>
<i>I saw you </i>♪

1804
01:32:49,854 --> 01:32:52,146
♪ <i>Standing there</i>
<i>In the light of the window</i> ♪

1805
